  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0007_c9566ffd0c03.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 157px;\" /><br />In first quadrant <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math> meet at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Hence, the required area <math><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;sq. units"
